    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. This light, sharp\nclaw lets the bearer move first occasionally.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "軽くて　鋭い　ツメ。\n持たせると　相手より　先に\n行動できることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "又轻又尖锐的爪子。\n携带后，有时能比对手\n先一步行动。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Garra ligera y afilada que permite que el Pokémon que\nla lleve ataque a veces el primero.",
